      "sourceHash": "5bb7b43b24b82e34f849756fb03d12a2f34d756ee6b166f62bb61a8ba1a8413f",
      "contextFingerprint": "c701f725421998bdb6185527df286ee4b11fae2a528f67a802c66ab83b220cc0",
      "sourceText": "**里程计标定：** 里程计标定是指通过对机器人里程计进行精确的校准和调整，以减小或消除里程计测量中的误差和不准确性。例如，可以通过测量调整轮胎直径和轴距等参数来校准机器人的线速度和角速度，从而使里程计测量结果更加准确。里程计标定的主要目标是确保里程计测量结果与实际机器人的运动轨迹一致，从而提高机器人的定位精度和路径规划准确性。",
      "translatedText": "**Odometry calibration:** Odometry calibration refers to the precise calibration and adjustment of a robot's odometry to reduce or eliminate errors and inaccuracies in odometry measurements\\. For example, parameters such as wheel diameter and wheelbase can be adjusted through measurement to calibrate the robot's linear velocity and angular velocity, thereby making odometry measurements more accurate\\. The main goal of odometry calibration is to ensure that odometry measurements are consistent with the actual motion trajectory of the robot, thereby improving the robot's localization accuracy and path planning accuracy\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 221,
        "outputTokens": 114,
        "costUsd": 0.000204
      }
